message: "If you reference this concept paper, please cite as below."
title: "AI-Supported Decision Assistance in Postmortem Kidney Transplantation — A Concept Paper"
authors:
  - family-names: Alfarra
    given-names: Mohammed
    affiliation: "Kaun AI gGmbH, Berlin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-5707-8102"
type: report
abstract: >
  A decision-science framework for AI-supported, assistive decision assistance
  at the center level in postmortem kidney transplantation in the Eurotransplant
  context, optimizing decision quality under uncertainty rather than the
  prediction of single outcomes. Three-phase study architecture (retrospective
  cohort, prospective shadow mode, interventional pilot) with parallel
  translational pathway addressing MDR and EU AI Act compliance.
keywords:
  - kidney transplantation
  - decision support
  - clinical decision making
  - decision curve analysis
  - net benefit
  - artificial intelligence
  - medical device regulation
  - EU AI Act
  - Eurotransplant
